  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Lake Victoria Research Initiative VicRes          (VicRes)2009-2015</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lake Victoria Research Initiative(VicRes)2009-2015 - VicRes 2009-2015</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Denna fortsatta st&#xf6;d syftar till att st&#xe4;rka b&#xe5;de IUCEA och VicRes.    St&#xf6;det f&#xf6;resl&#xe5;s att utveckla en VicRes strategisk plan f&#xf6;r att        f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra den vetenskapliga kvaliteten av de finansierade projekten,  f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka informations-och kommunikations och att revidera       VicRes Management Policy och drift handboken - s&#xe4;rskilt n&#xe4;r det       g&#xe4;ller beslutsfattande, ekonomisk f&#xf6;rvaltning och rapportering.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This continued support aims at strengthening both IUCEA and VicRes.   Support is proposed to develop a VicRes Strategic Plan, to improve    the scientific quality of the funded projects, to strengthen          information and communication activities and to revise the VicRes     Management Policy and Operations Manual - in particular regarding     decision-making, financial management and reporting.</narrative>
  </description>
